OL,3,GNEWSAUK oil refinery broke toxic
OL,4,Apollution limits dozens of times,
OL,5,Adocuments reveal
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of the UK's biggest oil refineries
OL,8,Fspilled pollution into local rivers and
OL,9,Fthe Mersey Estuary on dozens of
OL,10,Foccasions in 2023 and 2024, documents
OL,11,Fshared exclusively with the BBC
OL,12,Fsuggest.
OL,14,FEET Fuels, formerly known as Essar,
OL,15,Fwhich runs Stanlow refinery, pleaded
OL,16,Fguilty this year to 12 charges of
OL,17,Fbreaching environmental law between
OL,18,F2018 and 2020.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
