OL,3,GNEWSAUK oil refinery broke toxic
OL,4,Apollution limits dozens of times,
OL,5,Adocuments reveal
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut documents obtained by investigative
OL,8,Fjournalists from SourceMaterial
OL,9,Fdescribe other breaches from the
OL,10,Frefinery in Ellesmere Port, Cheshire,
OL,11,Fwith toxic chemicals and oil regularly
OL,12,Fspilled into the waterways and even
OL,13,Fgroundwater.
OL,15,FEET Fuels said it "takes its
OL,16,Fenvironmental responsibilities
OL,17,Fextremely seriously".
